        <!-- ================= LEGEND ================= -->
        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;缩写&lt;/b&gt;：API = Application Programming Interface（应用程序编程接口）；SDK = Software Development Kit（软件开发工具包）；IM = Instant Messaging（即时通讯）；IDE = Integrated Development Environment（集成开发环境）；MCP = Model Context Protocol（模型上下文协议）；LLM = Large Language Model（大语言模型）；PRD = Product Requirements Document（产品需求文档）。&#10;&lt;b&gt;读图方式&lt;/b&gt;：橙色 = 用户请求进入；绿色 = Mission 阶段编排主干，绿色虚线 = 验收与证据回流；粉色虚线 = 商城安装供给；紫色 = 专家团身份与投影；蓝色粗线 = 平台底座支撑。" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#D6DEE8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a5563;lineHeight=1.6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
